===Religion===
According to the 2016 census, Jacanos were 59.3% [[Petran Catholic Church|Petran Catholic]], 13.1% [[Zamarra Catholic Church|Zamarra Catholic]], and 1.3% other Christian denominations, while 19.2% were Agnostics and Atheists, 2.4% Jewish, and 4.7% followed other religions, including [[Islam]], [[Buddhism]], [[Armazism]] and other [[Paganism|Pagan religions]].
